ree cycles: morning, afternoon, and night.<br> Rhana must survive until the end of the day to face a boss and progress in the adventure. At the start of each cycle, abilities can be upgraded in the shop, preparing for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 8 types of magic projectiles\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced mobility mechanics\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 15 character upgrades\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemy types Bosses with unique personalities</p></li></ul>","developers":["Asthon Entertainment Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531180/9a4cd96e8c1035bca7d2a061981c330bde6cd1cf/header.jpg?t=1750196867","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531180/1603226834/7a27b7f683712e0d83464d1a2c4a736d88f574d4/1750858593/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747922586","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531180/1603226834/7a27b7f683712e0d83464d1a2c4a736d88f574d4/1750858593/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747922586","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531180/1603226834/7a27b7f683712e0d83464d1a2c4a736d88f574d4/1750858593/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747922586","id":257143001,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143001/movie480.mp4?t=1747922586","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143001/movie_max.mp4?t=1747922586"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143001/6d379e99bb5a315d32224a9ae136d5e4a0162a3b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747922586","webm":{"